      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "cess-hero",
          "type": "hero",
          "title": "The Cessation",
          "subtitle": "Technology fails faster than people can understand why."
        },
        {
          "id": "cess-prose",
          "type": "prose",
          "paragraphs": [
            "The Cessation is a systems failure, not a clean reset. Water, food, medicine, transport, communications and public trust fail on different clocks.",
            "At the same time, weakened boundaries make the hidden world easier to encounter precisely when people have the least capacity to interpret it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "cess-timeline",
